{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55723","headline":"颂 二 · 师备","name":"颂 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奇哉一灵叟，那顿许吺吺（音兜）。\n风起引箜篌，迷子争头凑。\n设使緫不是，虾蟆张大口。\n开口不开口，终是犯灵叟。\n欲识个中意，南星真北斗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"师备","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55723.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55723","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}